  ],
  "duration_s": 536.707007,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "您知道中国此生必看的十大壮丽奇观里，最震撼的是哪一个吗？有人说是兵马俑那支沉睡两千两百年的地下军团。有人说是雄志千年的黄山，云海错了，黄山排在第十位。兵马俑也压不住榜首，真正排榜首的那一处，不在中原，不在江南，真把世界屋脊硬生生劈开一道口子谷底。长着热带的树，抬头就是终年不化的雪。今天咱们就来盘点中国十大此生必看的壮丽奇观，还是咱们的老规矩开讲。之前劳烦各位老友顺手点亮红心，评论区，打个来了让我看看今天又有多少知音来捧场。第十名，安徽黄山黄山，您太熟了，五岳归来不看山，黄山归来不看月，说的就是他，可大部分人上黄山的时间挑错了，大晴天，人挤人，排着队在那个迎客松前面拍张合影就下来了。真正懂黄山的人，盼的是阴天，下雨，雨一停，山风一吹云就从谷底往上涌，大大小小的风头全被云淹了，只剩下尖尖露在外面，像海上的小岛，您站在崖边，脚底下，白茫茫一片，云在动，小岛也在动。那一刻，您就明白，古人为什么管它叫云海，那不是以景，那是一片海。再看那些松树，长在光秃秃的花岗岩，石缝里没土，没水根就那么死死，咬着石头，枝干还往外伸，往上看，晴天看，他是树云里看，他是一笔墨徐霞客当年爬完黄山，写下渤海内外之名山，无如灰之黄山。他看见的跟您现在看见的是同一场云，这就是黄山的脾气，宁越挑好天气，去，越看不见他最好的样子。第九名鸣沙山月牙泉，甘肃敦煌这一处没什么说道，就一个字怪，四面全是沙山风，一年刮到头沙子一天到晚往谷底滚可谷底，偏偏躺着一汪水，形状像一弯月牙两千多年没被填平过。您越琢磨越觉得不可思议，一边是能把骆驼埋掉的沙，一边是不肯干，不肯浑的水，就这么脸对脸呆了两千年。所以当地人管他叫沙井叫，要全都盼着，它是活的真去看。最好的时候是黄昏，您爬到沙梁上坐下来，太阳往下沉，一边是金灿灿的沙海风，把沙棘吹的跟刀片子似的，一道一道全是棱。另一边，就那一碗水，安安静静躺着，把天光收在里面，苍凉和生机中间就隔着一条沙棘，一眼看尽风沙。说了，两千年的，我要填平你。泉水说了两千年的，我还在就冲这一生，我还在他值得排。第九，第八名，黄果树瀑布，贵州安顺瀑布，谁没见过？可黄果树有个别人没有的带鱼，您能走到它后面去。瀑布底下那道悬崖里，瀑着一条一百多米长的石缝叫水帘洞，人从侧面一步步钻进去。走到正中间的时候，您就站在这挂瀑布的背面了，头顶上是压下来的。水脚底下是湿的石头，成吨成吨的水从眼前砸下去，隔着一层水木外面什么都模糊了，耳朵先受不了，那不是水声，是一堵墙，一直在您旁边炸开，嗡嗡嗡，把整个脑子灌满。八六版西游记片尾师徒四个，就是从这儿踩过去的。多少人小时候在电视上看过，可不知道脚底下真有这么个地方。外边是一百多米宽的水，万马奔腾里头是一步一滴水的幽深，石缝，一墙之隔，两个世界，这种能把手伸进瀑布肚子里的震撼。全国找不到第二家第七名、张家界、武陵源、湖南、张家界。前面几个是好，看到这儿开始震撼，三千根石柱一根一根从地上直插上去高的三百多米，低的也有几十米高，是刀削过一样的直壁柱跟柱之间留着一道成年人过不去的窄缝，您站在谷底往上看，头顶的天被切成成一条一条的风从缝里穿下来，声音都是斜的这不是山，这是一排排站着的石头，它怎么来的？三亿多年前，这一带是一片平坦的沙岩台地。后来地壳抬起来，水顺着石头里的裂缝往下切一条缝，一年深一点点切了三亿年，把一整块地切成了三千根柱子。别人您是长出来的，它是刻出来的。赶上起云雾的日子，云不进谷底就横在半山腰上面露着一排柱头，下面藏着一整片谷整片枫林，看着就像悬在空中，当地人说是三千奇风八百秀水，这不是哪位？古人写出来的，是老天爷拿水。当刀一刀一刀削出来的地骨，第六名，秦始皇陵兵马俑、陕西西安这一处不用我说，您也听过世界第八大奇迹，可他最厉害的地方不在多，在真八千多个泥人排成方阵，一个一个都不重样。您弯下腰细看，能看见特别小的东西，有的陶俑鞋底上还留着一道一道的针脚纹，有的胳膊内侧有一个工匠按下去的手指印儿。两千两百多年了，那个人早没了，名字也没留下来，可他的指纹还在泥上，再往前排，看最前面那几排不穿铠甲，都是些十几二十出头的小伙子，脸是照着真人做的，有人嘴角往下抿着，有人眼神发愣，不知道在想什么。他们不是雕塑，是一支被泥封了两千两百年还没开口的队伍，您站在坑边上，一整个坑的人齐刷刷朝着一个方向站着，他们等的那个皇帝就睡在旁边，那座至今没打开的地宫里。前面这五个地方是大地给咱们看的奇景，这一处是人给咱们留下的奇景。从第十到第六名，黄山是等一场雨才看得见的山。鸣沙山是一汪跟沙子对峙了两千年的水，黄果树是能走到他背面去的瀑布。张家界是水拿三亿年刻出来的三千根石头柱子。兵马俑是带的工匠指纹的八千个人，可他们还不是最壮丽的。接下来第五道第一名，一个比一个狠，有一处工城，两千两百多年没筑过一道坝，今天还在给几千万人供水，有一座寺庙定在百米的绝壁上，一千五百年没钓过一片吧，可排榜首。那一处是地球自己拉的一道口子，五千米的落差，谁站上去都得输。他是哪里？他凭什么排在兵马俑前面，下一集已经同步更新，点开我的头像，进入主页，就能看到点个关注。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00001",
      "start_ms": 290,
      "end_ms": 3450,
      "text": "您知道中国此生必看的十大壮丽奇观里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00002",
      "start_ms": 3630,
      "end_ms": 5430,
      "text": "最震撼的是哪一个吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00003",
      "start_ms": 6050,
      "end_ms": 10270,
      "text": "有人说是兵马俑那支沉睡两千两百年的地下军团。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00004",
      "start_ms": 10990,
      "end_ms": 13490,
      "text": "有人说是雄志千年的黄山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00005",
      "start_ms": 13530,
      "end_ms": 15050,
      "text": "云海错了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00006",
      "start_ms": 15450,
      "end_ms": 17270,
      "text": "黄山排在第十位。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00007",
      "start_ms": 18010,
      "end_ms": 20030,
      "text": "兵马俑也压不住榜首，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00008",
      "start_ms": 20450,
      "end_ms": 23010,
      "text": "真正排榜首的那一处，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00009",
      "start_ms": 23390,
      "end_ms": 24390,
      "text": "不在中原，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00010",
      "start_ms": 24870,
      "end_ms": 25890,
      "text": "不在江南，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00011",
      "start_ms": 26330,
      "end_ms": 31740,
      "text": "真把世界屋脊硬生生劈开一道口子谷底。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00012",
      "start_ms": 31820,
      "end_ms": 33160,
      "text": "长着热带的树，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00013",
      "start_ms": 33420,
      "end_ms": 35920,
      "text": "抬头就是终年不化的雪。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00014",
      "start_ms": 36360,
      "end_ms": 40580,
      "text": "今天咱们就来盘点中国十大此生必看的壮丽奇观，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00015",
      "start_ms": 41420,
      "end_ms": 43520,
      "text": "还是咱们的老规矩开讲。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00016",
      "start_ms": 43540,
      "end_ms": 46740,
      "text": "之前劳烦各位老友顺手点亮红心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00017",
      "start_ms": 47040,
      "end_ms": 47660,
      "text": "评论区，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00018",
      "start_ms": 47660,
      "end_ms": 52360,
      "text": "打个来了让我看看今天又有多少知音来捧场。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00019",
      "start_ms": 52780,
      "end_ms": 53440,
      "text": "第十名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00020",
      "start_ms": 53920,
      "end_ms": 56260,
      "text": "安徽黄山黄山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00021",
      "start_ms": 56260,
      "end_ms": 57280,
      "text": "您太熟了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00022",
      "start_ms": 57720,
      "end_ms": 59555,
      "text": "五岳归来不看山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00023",
      "start_ms": 60020,
      "end_ms": 61495,
      "text": "黄山归来不看月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00024",
      "start_ms": 61950,
      "end_ms": 62955,
      "text": "说的就是他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00025",
      "start_ms": 63560,
      "end_ms": 67005,
      "text": "可大部分人上黄山的时间挑错了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00026",
      "start_ms": 67480,
      "end_ms": 68235,
      "text": "大晴天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00027",
      "start_ms": 68740,
      "end_ms": 69435,
      "text": "人挤人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00028",
      "start_ms": 69990,
      "end_ms": 73935,
      "text": "排着队在那个迎客松前面拍张合影就下来了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00029",
      "start_ms": 74700,
      "end_ms": 76665,
      "text": "真正懂黄山的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00030",
      "start_ms": 77040,
      "end_ms": 78180,
      "text": "盼的是阴天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00031",
      "start_ms": 78280,
      "end_ms": 78785,
      "text": "下雨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00032",
      "start_ms": 79240,
      "end_ms": 80135,
      "text": "雨一停，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00033",
      "start_ms": 80560,
      "end_ms": 83775,
      "text": "山风一吹云就从谷底往上涌，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00034",
      "start_ms": 84100,
      "end_ms": 86905,
      "text": "大大小小的风头全被云淹了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00035",
      "start_ms": 87210,
      "end_ms": 88965,
      "text": "只剩下尖尖露在外面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00036",
      "start_ms": 89560,
      "end_ms": 90945,
      "text": "像海上的小岛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00037",
      "start_ms": 91370,
      "end_ms": 92945,
      "text": "您站在崖边，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00038",
      "start_ms": 93360,
      "end_ms": 94060,
      "text": "脚底下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00039",
      "start_ms": 94160,
      "end_ms": 95455,
      "text": "白茫茫一片，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00040",
      "start_ms": 95860,
      "end_ms": 96680,
      "text": "云在动，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00041",
      "start_ms": 96960,
      "end_ms": 98045,
      "text": "小岛也在动。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00042",
      "start_ms": 98920,
      "end_ms": 99580,
      "text": "那一刻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00043",
      "start_ms": 99580,
      "end_ms": 100280,
      "text": "您就明白，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00044",
      "start_ms": 100280,
      "end_ms": 102325,
      "text": "古人为什么管它叫云海，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00045",
      "start_ms": 102710,
      "end_ms": 103815,
      "text": "那不是以景，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00046",
      "start_ms": 104200,
      "end_ms": 105225,
      "text": "那是一片海。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00047",
      "start_ms": 105710,
      "end_ms": 106785,
      "text": "再看那些松树，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00048",
      "start_ms": 107250,
      "end_ms": 109050,
      "text": "长在光秃秃的花岗岩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00049",
      "start_ms": 109050,
      "end_ms": 110545,
      "text": "石缝里没土，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00050",
      "start_ms": 110850,
      "end_ms": 112620,
      "text": "没水根就那么死死，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00051",
      "start_ms": 112640,
      "end_ms": 113495,
      "text": "咬着石头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00052",
      "start_ms": 113970,
      "end_ms": 115250,
      "text": "枝干还往外伸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00053",
      "start_ms": 115550,
      "end_ms": 116455,
      "text": "往上看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00054",
      "start_ms": 117020,
      "end_ms": 117800,
      "text": "晴天看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00055",
      "start_ms": 117800,
      "end_ms": 119680,
      "text": "他是树云里看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00056",
      "start_ms": 119680,
      "end_ms": 123445,
      "text": "他是一笔墨徐霞客当年爬完黄山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00057",
      "start_ms": 124270,
      "end_ms": 126715,
      "text": "写下渤海内外之名山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00058",
      "start_ms": 127370,
      "end_ms": 128935,
      "text": "无如灰之黄山。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00059",
      "start_ms": 129690,
      "end_ms": 133585,
      "text": "他看见的跟您现在看见的是同一场云，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00060",
      "start_ms": 134050,
      "end_ms": 135665,
      "text": "这就是黄山的脾气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00061",
      "start_ms": 136450,
      "end_ms": 138110,
      "text": "宁越挑好天气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00062",
      "start_ms": 138210,
      "end_ms": 138565,
      "text": "去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00063",
      "start_ms": 139150,
      "end_ms": 141375,
      "text": "越看不见他最好的样子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00064",
      "start_ms": 141780,
      "end_ms": 144845,
      "text": "第九名鸣沙山月牙泉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00065",
      "start_ms": 145200,
      "end_ms": 148385,
      "text": "甘肃敦煌这一处没什么说道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00066",
      "start_ms": 148690,
      "end_ms": 150005,
      "text": "就一个字怪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00067",
      "start_ms": 150510,
      "end_ms": 152910,
      "text": "四面全是沙山风，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00068",
      "start_ms": 152990,
      "end_ms": 158150,
      "text": "一年刮到头沙子一天到晚往谷底滚可谷底，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00069",
      "start_ms": 158190,
      "end_ms": 159615,
      "text": "偏偏躺着一汪水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00070",
      "start_ms": 160090,
      "end_ms": 164765,
      "text": "形状像一弯月牙两千多年没被填平过。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00071",
      "start_ms": 165290,
      "end_ms": 167485,
      "text": "您越琢磨越觉得不可思议，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00072",
      "start_ms": 168150,
      "end_ms": 170615,
      "text": "一边是能把骆驼埋掉的沙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00073",
      "start_ms": 171090,
      "end_ms": 172605,
      "text": "一边是不肯干，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00074",
      "start_ms": 172880,
      "end_ms": 173895,
      "text": "不肯浑的水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00075",
      "start_ms": 174500,
      "end_ms": 176985,
      "text": "就这么脸对脸呆了两千年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00076",
      "start_ms": 177430,
      "end_ms": 180180,
      "text": "所以当地人管他叫沙井叫，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00077",
      "start_ms": 180180,
      "end_ms": 182060,
      "text": "要全都盼着，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00078",
      "start_ms": 182060,
      "end_ms": 184400,
      "text": "它是活的真去看。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00079",
      "start_ms": 184940,
      "end_ms": 186380,
      "text": "最好的时候是黄昏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00080",
      "start_ms": 186860,
      "end_ms": 188640,
      "text": "您爬到沙梁上坐下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00081",
      "start_ms": 189300,
      "end_ms": 190440,
      "text": "太阳往下沉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00082",
      "start_ms": 191300,
      "end_ms": 194140,
      "text": "一边是金灿灿的沙海风，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00083",
      "start_ms": 194240,
      "end_ms": 196480,
      "text": "把沙棘吹的跟刀片子似的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00084",
      "start_ms": 197040,
      "end_ms": 198520,
      "text": "一道一道全是棱。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00085",
      "start_ms": 199160,
      "end_ms": 199800,
      "text": "另一边，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00086",
      "start_ms": 199800,
      "end_ms": 200740,
      "text": "就那一碗水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00087",
      "start_ms": 201160,
      "end_ms": 202520,
      "text": "安安静静躺着，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00088",
      "start_ms": 202700,
      "end_ms": 204320,
      "text": "把天光收在里面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00089",
      "start_ms": 204760,
      "end_ms": 208340,
      "text": "苍凉和生机中间就隔着一条沙棘，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00090",
      "start_ms": 208880,
      "end_ms": 211190,
      "text": "一眼看尽风沙。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00091",
      "start_ms": 211210,
      "end_ms": 211490,
      "text": "说了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00092",
      "start_ms": 211490,
      "end_ms": 212430,
      "text": "两千年的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00093",
      "start_ms": 212490,
      "end_ms": 213570,
      "text": "我要填平你。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00094",
      "start_ms": 214090,
      "end_ms": 215970,
      "text": "泉水说了两千年的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00095",
      "start_ms": 216030,
      "end_ms": 218350,
      "text": "我还在就冲这一生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00096",
      "start_ms": 218390,
      "end_ms": 220090,
      "text": "我还在他值得排。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00097",
      "start_ms": 220090,
      "end_ms": 220510,
      "text": "第九，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00098",
      "start_ms": 220750,
      "end_ms": 221470,
      "text": "第八名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00099",
      "start_ms": 222010,
      "end_ms": 223390,
      "text": "黄果树瀑布，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00100",
      "start_ms": 223690,
      "end_ms": 226009,
      "text": "贵州安顺瀑布，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00101",
      "start_ms": 226030,
      "end_ms": 226850,
      "text": "谁没见过？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00102",
      "start_ms": 227350,
      "end_ms": 230210,
      "text": "可黄果树有个别人没有的带鱼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00103",
      "start_ms": 230630,
      "end_ms": 232250,
      "text": "您能走到它后面去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00104",
      "start_ms": 232650,
      "end_ms": 234450,
      "text": "瀑布底下那道悬崖里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00105",
      "start_ms": 235030,
      "end_ms": 239485,
      "text": "瀑着一条一百多米长的石缝叫水帘洞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00106",
      "start_ms": 240330,
      "end_ms": 242630,
      "text": "人从侧面一步步钻进去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00107",
      "start_ms": 243050,
      "end_ms": 244790,
      "text": "走到正中间的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00108",
      "start_ms": 245270,
      "end_ms": 248190,
      "text": "您就站在这挂瀑布的背面了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00109",
      "start_ms": 248530,
      "end_ms": 250290,
      "text": "头顶上是压下来的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00110",
      "start_ms": 250290,
      "end_ms": 253110,
      "text": "水脚底下是湿的石头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00111",
      "start_ms": 253790,
      "end_ms": 257290,
      "text": "成吨成吨的水从眼前砸下去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00112",
      "start_ms": 257910,
      "end_ms": 261370,
      "text": "隔着一层水木外面什么都模糊了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00113",
      "start_ms": 261730,
      "end_ms": 262930,
      "text": "耳朵先受不了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00114",
      "start_ms": 263350,
      "end_ms": 264290,
      "text": "那不是水声，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00115",
      "start_ms": 264730,
      "end_ms": 265850,
      "text": "是一堵墙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00116",
      "start_ms": 266050,
      "end_ms": 267710,
      "text": "一直在您旁边炸开，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00117",
      "start_ms": 268130,
      "end_ms": 268910,
      "text": "嗡嗡嗡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00118",
      "start_ms": 268950,
      "end_ms": 270020,
      "text": "把整个脑子灌满。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00119",
      "start_ms": 270540,
      "end_ms": 273440,
      "text": "八六版西游记片尾师徒四个，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00120",
      "start_ms": 273440,
      "end_ms": 275040,
      "text": "就是从这儿踩过去的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00121",
      "start_ms": 275460,
      "end_ms": 277840,
      "text": "多少人小时候在电视上看过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00122",
      "start_ms": 278260,
      "end_ms": 280960,
      "text": "可不知道脚底下真有这么个地方。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00123",
      "start_ms": 281540,
      "end_ms": 283880,
      "text": "外边是一百多米宽的水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00124",
      "start_ms": 284260,
      "end_ms": 289160,
      "text": "万马奔腾里头是一步一滴水的幽深，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00125",
      "start_ms": 289240,
      "end_ms": 289700,
      "text": "石缝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00126",
      "start_ms": 290380,
      "end_ms": 291480,
      "text": "一墙之隔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00127",
      "start_ms": 291840,
      "end_ms": 292740,
      "text": "两个世界，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00128",
      "start_ms": 293300,
      "end_ms": 297055,
      "text": "这种能把手伸进瀑布肚子里的震撼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00129",
      "start_ms": 297450,
      "end_ms": 303630,
      "text": "全国找不到第二家第七名、张家界、武陵源、湖南、张家界。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00130",
      "start_ms": 304310,
      "end_ms": 305830,
      "text": "前面几个是好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00131",
      "start_ms": 305850,
      "end_ms": 308010,
      "text": "看到这儿开始震撼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00132",
      "start_ms": 308630,
      "end_ms": 314450,
      "text": "三千根石柱一根一根从地上直插上去高的三百多米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00133",
      "start_ms": 314670,
      "end_ms": 316730,
      "text": "低的也有几十米高，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00134",
      "start_ms": 316790,
      "end_ms": 323310,
      "text": "是刀削过一样的直壁柱跟柱之间留着一道成年人过不去的窄缝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00135",
      "start_ms": 323750,
      "end_ms": 325590,
      "text": "您站在谷底往上看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00136",
      "start_ms": 325950,
      "end_ms": 330460,
      "text": "头顶的天被切成成一条一条的风从缝里穿下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00137",
      "start_ms": 330680,
      "end_ms": 333700,
      "text": "声音都是斜的这不是山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00138",
      "start_ms": 334060,
      "end_ms": 336500,
      "text": "这是一排排站着的石头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00139",
      "start_ms": 337100,
      "end_ms": 338120,
      "text": "它怎么来的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00140",
      "start_ms": 338440,
      "end_ms": 339680,
      "text": "三亿多年前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00141",
      "start_ms": 340200,
      "end_ms": 343380,
      "text": "这一带是一片平坦的沙岩台地。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00142",
      "start_ms": 343940,
      "end_ms": 345480,
      "text": "后来地壳抬起来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00143",
      "start_ms": 346100,
      "end_ms": 349860,
      "text": "水顺着石头里的裂缝往下切一条缝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00144",
      "start_ms": 350020,
      "end_ms": 352840,
      "text": "一年深一点点切了三亿年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00145",
      "start_ms": 353320,
      "end_ms": 356500,
      "text": "把一整块地切成了三千根柱子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00146",
      "start_ms": 356820,
      "end_ms": 358470,
      "text": "别人您是长出来的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00147",
      "start_ms": 358590,
      "end_ms": 359805,
      "text": "它是刻出来的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00148",
      "start_ms": 360410,
      "end_ms": 362185,
      "text": "赶上起云雾的日子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00149",
      "start_ms": 362500,
      "end_ms": 368575,
      "text": "云不进谷底就横在半山腰上面露着一排柱头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00150",
      "start_ms": 369070,
      "end_ms": 372400,
      "text": "下面藏着一整片谷整片枫林，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00151",
      "start_ms": 372640,
      "end_ms": 374845,
      "text": "看着就像悬在空中，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00152",
      "start_ms": 375310,
      "end_ms": 379255,
      "text": "当地人说是三千奇风八百秀水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00153",
      "start_ms": 380080,
      "end_ms": 381020,
      "text": "这不是哪位？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00154",
      "start_ms": 381040,
      "end_ms": 382235,
      "text": "古人写出来的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00155",
      "start_ms": 382820,
      "end_ms": 384200,
      "text": "是老天爷拿水。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00156",
      "start_ms": 384260,
      "end_ms": 387385,
      "text": "当刀一刀一刀削出来的地骨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00157",
      "start_ms": 387750,
      "end_ms": 388445,
      "text": "第六名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00158",
      "start_ms": 388850,
      "end_ms": 394240,
      "text": "秦始皇陵兵马俑、陕西西安这一处不用我说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00159",
      "start_ms": 394240,
      "end_ms": 397545,
      "text": "您也听过世界第八大奇迹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00160",
      "start_ms": 398170,
      "end_ms": 400355,
      "text": "可他最厉害的地方不在多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00161",
      "start_ms": 400670,
      "end_ms": 403605,
      "text": "在真八千多个泥人排成方阵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00162",
      "start_ms": 404320,
      "end_ms": 405605,
      "text": "一个一个都不重样。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00163",
      "start_ms": 406010,
      "end_ms": 407815,
      "text": "您弯下腰细看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00164",
      "start_ms": 408280,
      "end_ms": 410145,
      "text": "能看见特别小的东西，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00165",
      "start_ms": 411000,
      "end_ms": 415505,
      "text": "有的陶俑鞋底上还留着一道一道的针脚纹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00166",
      "start_ms": 416240,
      "end_ms": 420715,
      "text": "有的胳膊内侧有一个工匠按下去的手指印儿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00167",
      "start_ms": 421050,
      "end_ms": 422515,
      "text": "两千两百多年了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00168",
      "start_ms": 422850,
      "end_ms": 423950,
      "text": "那个人早没了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00169",
      "start_ms": 424230,
      "end_ms": 425615,
      "text": "名字也没留下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00170",
      "start_ms": 426260,
      "end_ms": 428655,
      "text": "可他的指纹还在泥上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00171",
      "start_ms": 429080,
      "end_ms": 429840,
      "text": "再往前排，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00172",
      "start_ms": 429840,
      "end_ms": 432815,
      "text": "看最前面那几排不穿铠甲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00173",
      "start_ms": 433350,
      "end_ms": 436305,
      "text": "都是些十几二十出头的小伙子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00174",
      "start_ms": 437040,
      "end_ms": 438775,
      "text": "脸是照着真人做的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00175",
      "start_ms": 439350,
      "end_ms": 441285,
      "text": "有人嘴角往下抿着，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00176",
      "start_ms": 441750,
      "end_ms": 443155,
      "text": "有人眼神发愣，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00177",
      "start_ms": 443800,
      "end_ms": 445165,
      "text": "不知道在想什么。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00178",
      "start_ms": 445570,
      "end_ms": 446865,
      "text": "他们不是雕塑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00179",
      "start_ms": 447400,
      "end_ms": 453025,
      "text": "是一支被泥封了两千两百年还没开口的队伍，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00180",
      "start_ms": 453800,
      "end_ms": 455225,
      "text": "您站在坑边上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00181",
      "start_ms": 455770,
      "end_ms": 459235,
      "text": "一整个坑的人齐刷刷朝着一个方向站着，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00182",
      "start_ms": 459670,
      "end_ms": 463330,
      "text": "他们等的那个皇帝就睡在旁边，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00183",
      "start_ms": 463350,
      "end_ms": 465775,
      "text": "那座至今没打开的地宫里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00184",
      "start_ms": 466670,
      "end_ms": 471025,
      "text": "前面这五个地方是大地给咱们看的奇景，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00185",
      "start_ms": 471810,
      "end_ms": 475045,
      "text": "这一处是人给咱们留下的奇景。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00186",
      "start_ms": 475420,
      "end_ms": 477485,
      "text": "从第十到第六名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00187",
      "start_ms": 477900,
      "end_ms": 480855,
      "text": "黄山是等一场雨才看得见的山。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00188",
      "start_ms": 481590,
      "end_ms": 485125,
      "text": "鸣沙山是一汪跟沙子对峙了两千年的水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00189",
      "start_ms": 485940,
      "end_ms": 489035,
      "text": "黄果树是能走到他背面去的瀑布。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00190",
      "start_ms": 489430,
      "end_ms": 493125,
      "text": "张家界是水拿三亿年刻出来的三千根石头柱子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00191",
      "start_ms": 493550,
      "end_ms": 496285,
      "text": "兵马俑是带的工匠指纹的八千个人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00192",
      "start_ms": 497030,
      "end_ms": 498855,
      "text": "可他们还不是最壮丽的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00193",
      "start_ms": 499230,
      "end_ms": 500850,
      "text": "接下来第五道第一名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00194",
      "start_ms": 501110,
      "end_ms": 502005,
      "text": "一个比一个狠，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00195",
      "start_ms": 502470,
      "end_ms": 503665,
      "text": "有一处工城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00196",
      "start_ms": 504050,
      "end_ms": 506575,
      "text": "两千两百多年没筑过一道坝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00197",
      "start_ms": 507050,
      "end_ms": 509585,
      "text": "今天还在给几千万人供水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00198",
      "start_ms": 510300,
      "end_ms": 513475,
      "text": "有一座寺庙定在百米的绝壁上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00199",
      "start_ms": 514000,
      "end_ms": 516545,
      "text": "一千五百年没钓过一片吧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00200",
      "start_ms": 516960,
      "end_ms": 517920,
      "text": "可排榜首。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00201",
      "start_ms": 517920,
      "end_ms": 521105,
      "text": "那一处是地球自己拉的一道口子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00202",
      "start_ms": 521540,
      "end_ms": 522965,
      "text": "五千米的落差，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00203",
      "start_ms": 523840,
      "end_ms": 525195,
      "text": "谁站上去都得输。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00204",
      "start_ms": 525750,
      "end_ms": 526475,
      "text": "他是哪里？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00205",
      "start_ms": 527160,
      "end_ms": 529115,
      "text": "他凭什么排在兵马俑前面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00206",
      "start_ms": 529520,
      "end_ms": 531565,
      "text": "下一集已经同步更新，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00207",
      "start_ms": 531920,
      "end_ms": 533220,
      "text": "点开我的头像，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00208",
      "start_ms": 533340,
      "end_ms": 534185,
      "text": "进入主页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5a1f4e863379cd2e_s00209",
      "start_ms": 534400,
      "end_ms": 536005,
      "text": "就能看到点个关注。"
    }
  ],
